Expected answer: Pressburg

Benchmark evidence relations:
1. Princess Clotilde of Saxe-Coburg and Gotha | spouse | Archduke Joseph Karl of Austria
2. Archduke Joseph Karl of Austria | place of birth | Pressburg

Accepted semantic graph so far:
(empty)

